  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "We've partnered with 21Vianet - one of the largest Internet service providers in China - to bring Azure's public cloud services to Chinese customers. Visit the <a title=\"Official Microsoft Blog\" href=\"https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2014/03/26/microsoft-becomes-the-first-global-public-cloud-provider-in-china-with-the-general-availability-of-microsoft-azure-in-the-region/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Official Microsoft Blog</a> for more information on today’s announcement.",
